{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Black Screen": 1,
    "Player": 17,
    "夏萝·努伊": 6,
    "暴躁的部族战士": 2,
    "米卢·努伊": 55,
    "蒂尔妲": 5,
    "马西娜·努伊": 7
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2502701",
      "subQuestName": "与米卢·努伊对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270901": {
            "id": "250270901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "也许应该采集声音的素材…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270902"
            ]
          },
          "250270902": {
            "id": "250270902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "声音的素材？嗯…您的意思是，将大自然的声音直接用在歌曲里吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270903"
            ]
          },
          "250270903": {
            "id": "250270903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "喔…这倒是一个好主意。很好！我就知道您聪明敏锐，咱们这就出发！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270904"
            ]
          },
          "250270904": {
            "id": "250270904",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "等会，你空着手去？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270905"
            ]
          },
          "250270905": {
            "id": "250270905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "当然。难道我要搬着一台留音机去野外取材吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270906"
            ]
          },
          "250270906": {
            "id": "250270906",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "放心吧，这次我们的目的只是确定哪些声音素材可用。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270907"
            ]
          },
          "250270907": {
            "id": "250270907",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "比如，鸭子扑扇翅膀的声音，鳍游龙钻进水里的波浪声，嵴锋龙走过时的隆隆脚步…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270908"
            ]
          },
          "250270908": {
            "id": "250270908",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "在确定了目标后，我会做好一切准备，再进行正式的声音素材采集…这就是后话了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270909"
            ]
          },
          "250270909": {
            "id": "250270909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "至于现在，咱们直接出发吧，事不宜迟啊！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502704",
      "subQuestName": "和米卢·努伊一起取材",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270401": {
            "id": "250270401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "瞧瞧前面那群鸟，太棒了！它的叫声…说不定能用作素材。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270402"
            ]
          },
          "250270402": {
            "id": "250270402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "但是，只有几只的话…它们的叫声还是太过单薄。如果之后能找到一整个族群，录下它们的整体叫声就好了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270403"
            ]
          },
          "250270403": {
            "id": "250270403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "等等，前面是鳍游龙群。听见它用爪子抓挠石头的声音了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270404"
            ]
          },
          "250270404": {
            "id": "250270404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "…它很敏感，咱们不能靠近。之后我会请部族里的专业人士来帮我取材。他们肯定能搞定这件事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270405"
            ]
          },
          "250270405": {
            "id": "250270405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "那是…正在比试的部族战士啊。不错，不错，这种真实的打斗声听起来非常好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270406"
            ]
          },
          "250270406": {
            "id": "250270406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "暴躁的部族战士",
            "text": "喂！旁边的是谁，要干什么！讨打是吗？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270407"
            ]
          },
          "250270407": {
            "id": "250270407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "我们正在取…材…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270408"
            ]
          },
          "250270408": {
            "id": "250270408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "暴躁的部族战士",
            "text": "取材？那我就让你取个痛快！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270409"
            ]
          },
          "250270409": {
            "id": "250270409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "#救，救命啊！{NICKNAME}，快拦住他！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502708",
      "subQuestName": "「劝走」暴躁的部族成员",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502709",
      "subQuestName": "和米卢·努伊对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271301": {
            "id": "250271301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "#呼…{NICKNAME}，你的身手真不错…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271302"
            ]
          },
          "250271302": {
            "id": "250271302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "看来，您很擅长说服这一类的暴躁老兄…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271304",
              "250271306"
            ]
          },
          "250271304": {
            "id": "250271304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "看得出来。从各方面都…看得出来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271307"
            ]
          },
          "250271307": {
            "id": "250271307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "虽然过程折腾了点…但无论如何，这次我都确定了不少可用的声音素材。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271308"
            ]
          },
          "250271308": {
            "id": "250271308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "只要做好准备，我就可以正式开始录制声音素材了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271309"
            ]
          },
          "250271309": {
            "id": "250271309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "唔，就先从「打斗声」开始采集吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271310"
            ]
          },
          "250271310": {
            "id": "250271310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "…不对，不对！不能从这个开始，还是找点正常的吧。"
          },
          "250271306": {
            "id": "250271306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "您真是够谦虚的。我再次感谢您。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502703",
      "subQuestName": "在店里询问客人的看法",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270301": {
            "id": "250270301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "哇！又有新唱片了，龙宝宝们肯定会很开心的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270302"
            ]
          },
          "250270302": {
            "id": "250270302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于米卢·努伊的唱片…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270303"
            ]
          },
          "250270303": {
            "id": "250270303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "我很喜欢米卢叔叔作的曲子，而且，我家的龙宝宝比我更喜欢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270304"
            ]
          },
          "250270304": {
            "id": "250270304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "每次它闹腾的时候，妈妈就放米卢叔叔的歌，它一听见曲子就会马上安静下来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270305"
            ]
          },
          "250270305": {
            "id": "250270305",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "唔，可是那些歌都好长好长，我都记不住歌词，没法唱歌给我家的龙宝宝听…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270306"
            ]
          },
          "250270306": {
            "id": "250270306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "嘿嘿，要是米卢叔叔能把歌词写短一点就好了，这样我天天都能唱歌给它听！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502702",
      "subQuestName": "在店里询问客人的看法",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270201": {
            "id": "250270201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "米卢先生又发出新唱片了。到底买不买呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270202"
            ]
          },
          "250270202": {
            "id": "250270202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于米卢·努伊的唱片…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270203"
            ]
          },
          "250270203": {
            "id": "250270203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "欸？他的唱片很好呀。夏萝和龙宝宝都很喜欢听呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270204"
            ]
          },
          "250270204": {
            "id": "250270204",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "每当她们淘气不愿意睡觉的时候，我都会放米卢先生的那首《颂春日》给她们听。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270205"
            ]
          },
          "250270205": {
            "id": "250270205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "她们听着听着，就会乖乖睡着，而且睡得可好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270206"
            ]
          },
          "250270206": {
            "id": "250270206",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "哎呀…但夏萝一直说，自己喜欢更激烈一些的曲子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270207"
            ]
          },
          "250270207": {
            "id": "250270207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "要是米卢先生能创作出几首更热闹的歌就好了。那样她肯定会玩得更开心…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502706",
      "subQuestName": "在店里询问客人的看法",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271401": {
            "id": "250271401",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "蒂尔妲",
            "text": "…米卢的风格还是一如既往。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271402"
            ]
          },
          "250271402": {
            "id": "250271402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于米卢·努伊的唱片…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271403"
            ]
          },
          "250271403": {
            "id": "250271403",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "蒂尔妲",
            "text": "咦？我很喜欢米卢的歌曲风格。在每天工作结束后，我都会听他的歌放松身心。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271404"
            ]
          },
          "250271404": {
            "id": "250271404",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "蒂尔妲",
            "text": "但是，从我个人的角度出发，有些歌曲中的歌词有些…呃，太复杂了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271405"
            ]
          },
          "250271405": {
            "id": "250271405",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "蒂尔妲",
            "text": "唉，如果他能做一张去掉歌词，只留下旋律的唱片就好了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502705",
      "subQuestName": "向米卢·努伊回报",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270501": {
            "id": "250270501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "怎么样？您帮我问到意见了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270502"
            ]
          },
          "250270502": {
            "id": "250270502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "听到了这样的意见…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270503"
            ]
          },
          "250270503": {
            "id": "250270503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "将顾客的意见告诉了米卢·努伊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270504"
            ]
          },
          "250270504": {
            "id": "250270504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "是，是这样吗？谢谢你，这些意见确实都很有价值。我也会尝试调整…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270505"
            ]
          },
          "250270505": {
            "id": "250270505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "但是听客人的口气…怎么已经把我的唱片彻底定位成「儿歌」了啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270506"
            ]
          },
          "250270506": {
            "id": "250270506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "不行，我必须要做出改变…但是，要从哪里改起呢…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502701",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270101": {
            "id": "250270101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "帕卡这小子…真是没法交流！他就不理解我的音乐理想！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270104"
            ]
          },
          "250270104": {
            "id": "250270104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "嚯，看起来你是一位…旅行者？向您问好，我是米卢·努伊，一名音乐家。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270105"
            ]
          },
          "250270105": {
            "id": "250270105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "如果你去过「花歌唱片店」的话，一定在流行区见到过我所创作的唱片。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270106"
            ]
          },
          "250270106": {
            "id": "250270106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "那份唱片里，包含着我对于「流行」的理解。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270107"
            ]
          },
          "250270107": {
            "id": "250270107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "只有帕卡那小子没法理解我，非要说我的音乐比起「流行乐」更像是「儿歌」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270108"
            ]
          },
          "250270108": {
            "id": "250270108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "无论我怎么坚持，他都要把我的唱片放进儿歌区！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270109"
            ]
          },
          "250270109": {
            "id": "250270109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "虽然…孩子们确实很喜欢啦，也有一些父母买回去给他们做礼物…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270110"
            ]
          },
          "250270110": {
            "id": "250270110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "但，但是孩子们是最敏锐的听众！整个部族里也有不少孩子…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270111"
            ]
          },
          "250270111": {
            "id": "250270111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "我的唱片在那么多孩子里流行，我认为！完全可以把它放进流行区！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502706",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270601": {
            "id": "250270601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "夏萝·努伊",
            "text": "嘿嘿，要是米卢叔叔能把歌词写短一点就好了，这样我天天都能唱歌给它听！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502707",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250270701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250270701": {
            "id": "250270701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "首先得问问顾客们的感觉呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270702"
            ]
          },
          "250270702": {
            "id": "250270702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "呃…我不反对您的意见。毕竟我之前也问过许多人了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270703"
            ]
          },
          "250270703": {
            "id": "250270703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "…不过，也许他们见了我，会本能地说一些客气话。从而没法说出真心的意见。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270704"
            ]
          },
          "250270704": {
            "id": "250270704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，能请您帮我去问问顾客们的意见吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250270705"
            ]
          },
          "250270705": {
            "id": "250270705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "面对您的时候，他们一定能说出…相对更加真实的意见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502710",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271001": {
            "id": "250271001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "流行，到底什么是流行？天哪…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502712",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271201": {
            "id": "250271201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "马西娜·努伊",
            "text": "要是米卢先生能创作出几首更热闹的歌就好了。那样她肯定会玩得更开心…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502715",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271501": {
            "id": "250271501",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "蒂尔妲",
            "text": "唉，如果他能做一张去掉歌词，只留下旋律的唱片就好了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502716",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250271601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250271601": {
            "id": "250271601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "流行…唉，到底什么才是流行…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271602"
            ]
          },
          "250271602": {
            "id": "250271602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你的音乐理想怎么样了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271603"
            ]
          },
          "250271603": {
            "id": "250271603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，很高兴再见到你。您问我的音乐理想，我只能说…我正在努力寻求突破。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271604"
            ]
          },
          "250271604": {
            "id": "250271604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "唉，大家到底想要什么样的流行乐呢？到底什么是流行感呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271605"
            ]
          },
          "250271605": {
            "id": "250271605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，我知道您是个懂得欣赏音乐的人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250271606"
            ]
          },
          "250271606": {
            "id": "250271606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "请您再用直觉给我些建议吧。您认为，我首先应该怎么做，才能制作出一首优秀的音乐？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2502799",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250279901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250279901": {
            "id": "250279901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "呼…好了，就是这里。看看周围，大自然的风景简直是展现无遗啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250279902"
            ]
          },
          "250279902": {
            "id": "250279902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "米卢·努伊",
            "text": "来吧，我们去周围逛逛，看看能找到什么有趣的声音素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}